        "cooked": "<p>This topic did seem to beg OX</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-314-writers-room-justice-comics-534-535\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-314-writers-room-justice-comics-534-535\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-314-writers-room-justice-comics-534-535\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #314 - Writers' Room: Justice Comics #534-535</a></h3>\n\n  <p>But just who are the April Fools, anyway?  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:21:28 We (and just who is we are in unclear) do some goofs, tell some stories, and read your letters! It's just a totally normal episode!&nbsp; Join us next week for more normal...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ead6f7bcc904e06f34a8ce5113a233b315c0c0e7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/ead6f7bcc904e06f34a8ce5113a233b315c0c0e7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ead6f7bcc904e06f34a8ce5113a233b315c0c0e7_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xvuifkqhtJHeETaXCF9xSclFiS3\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ead6f7bcc904e06f34a8ce5113a233b315c0c0e7_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ead6f7bcc904e06f34a8ce5113a233b315c0c0e7_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ead6f7bcc904e06f34a8ce5113a233b315c0c0e7_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"674B6F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2640×4093 2.07 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
