        "id": 262964,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-04-01T18:02:58.953Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ohh, fantastic opening, love it. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> They finally made it happen!</p>\n<p>Oh wow, the cover though <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Probably spoiled half the episode, lol</p>\n<p>I never knew there was a DBZ RPG. And their description of it reminds me of the Sailor Moon RPG my roomates and I couldn’t</p>\n<p>understand in college. XD</p>\n<p>Clearly, Adam needs Redbubble.</p>\n<p>I really like the use of Ray Manta to set this other villain up. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>It’s a double monologue, all the way!</p>\n<p>“And he’s gone” is always a funny line to end a scene on.</p>\n<p>Let’s hear it for crappy 80’s CGI! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Ooh, they’re going through a tunnel again <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>“Why Matt?” what a question to have to ask XD</p>\n<p>I love everyone running with the joke about Calypso’s age.</p>\n<p>Hey, it me! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I’m so glad I got one more “asbestos-coated anti-Ra room” out of them.</p>\n<p>Good ending gag too <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
